      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Choose a folder of images in **Training Images**.\n3. Press **Run**. **Save Captions** writes each image and its caption to `output/captions`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
